    skos:definition '''{"node": {
    "country": "United States",
    "notes": "There is a lot of contradictory information concerning this vessel. IMO 6401438 (ICES 48B1) known to be an Italian RV possibly but referred to as CP 451, not Bannock and active from 1966. USS Bannock Tug ATF 81, which went to Italy in 1979. IMO 7946203 is a Panamanian-registered tug called Bannock that has the callsign HO8888."
}}'''@en ;
